stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft : save valid form
    Draft --> Draft : update current version
    Draft --> UnderReview : submit
    UnderReview --> ChangesRequested : editor returns with comment
    ChangesRequested --> ChangesRequested : author edits
    ChangesRequested --> UnderReview : resubmit
    UnderReview --> Published : editor publishes
    Published --> [*]
